<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX CLOSES LOWER LED BY SPT, KOMERCNI.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX CLOSES LOWER LED BY SPT, KOMERCNI.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes lower on Thursday led by</p>
<p>Komercni Banka and SPT Telecom.</p>
<p>* Reuters Prague Real-time index down 15.2 crowns, 1.43 percent,   to 1,049.1.</p>
<p>* Turnover,</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka falls 39 crowns to 1,621. On</p>
<p>Thursday, Komercni said its first half net profits had fallen</p>
<p>to 1.64 billion crowns from 2.53 billion. The figures were well</p>
<p>below most analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom down 60 crowns to 3,820.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
